<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac revised short-term discount note rates Monday as follows:</p>
<p> -	 MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -	Overnight--5.10</p>
<p> -	Jan 10,15--5.13</p>
<p> -   Jan 22,27,29--5.17</p>
<p> -	Feb 10,13--5.20</p>
<p> -	  March 4--5.20</p>
<p> -  April 7, open--5.20</p>
<p> - April 7, closed--5.21</p>
</text>
